    "id": "LVMC-11-43-010-B",
    "title": "Operation of vehicles within a roundabout (B)",
    "text": "The following regulations pertain to the operation of vehicles within a roundabout: The operator of a vehicle entering a roundabout shall yield the right-of-way to vehicles already in the roundabout and wait for a gap in traffic before entering.",
    "source": "LVMC 11.43.010(B)"
  },
